  triage:title "Two sprint-doc-named colima integration tests plus their evidence artifact do not exist anywhere in the repository" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr BB6-QA-L4-1789275000 (ATM-QA-BB6-001, req-qa, independently confirmed), PR #1464 comment, verdict FAIL, 2026-09-13T02:00:00Z. The sprint doc's Tests section names two Integration (colima) tests -- task_events_shows_ready_reminders_and_started_for_prompted_task_only and disabled_task_reminder_override_yields_no_handoff_and_doctor_finding -- and Acceptance Criterion 1 requires a colima run proving zero prompt_handoff_record_failed lines. Neither test exists anywhere in the repository (confirmed via workspace-wide grep) and no BB.6 colima evidence artifact exists under site/reports/ or reports/colima/. Same defect class already ruled Blocking by fenix for BB4-001/ATM-QA-002 on this phase (in-process fixture substitutes do not satisfy the colima-evidence requirement). Ruled genuine per the BB4-001 precedent, no waiver." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
